Problema: Individual Progression puede vetar la subida de habilidad al pescar
basura. El retorno anticipado impide que Profession Experience conceda XP.
Solución: ejecutar todos los hooks de pesca, acumulando sus vetos. Se conserva
el veto a subir habilidad, sin perder los efectos independientes de cada hook.
Base: core mod-playerbots 7f12e89ee5f467a50e62eba1d525eac7dc953d03.

diff --git a/src/server/game/Scripting/ScriptDefines/PlayerScript.cpp b/src/server/game/Scripting/ScriptDefines/PlayerScript.cpp
--- a/src/server/game/Scripting/ScriptDefines/PlayerScript.cpp
+++ b/src/server/game/Scripting/ScriptDefines/PlayerScript.cpp
@@ -618,1 +618,7 @@
-    CALL_ENABLED_BOOLEAN_HOOKS(PlayerScript, PLAYERHOOK_ON_UPDATE_FISHING_SKILL, !script->OnPlayerUpdateFishingSkill(player, skill, zone_skill, chance, roll));
+    // All observers must run even when one vetoes the skill increase.
+    // Profession XP is independent of that increase (including fishing junk).
+    bool allowSkillGain = true;
+    CALL_ENABLED_HOOKS(PlayerScript, PLAYERHOOK_ON_UPDATE_FISHING_SKILL,
+        if (!script->OnPlayerUpdateFishingSkill(player, skill, zone_skill, chance, roll))
+            allowSkillGain = false);
+    return allowSkillGain;
